<title>SINGAPORE: Cycle and Carriage appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>Cycle and Carriage appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car retailer Cycle and Carriage Ltd said on Wednesday it had appointed Dato' Mohd Saleh Sulong as a director and non-executive chairman.</p>
<p>The company statement did not give any details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
